          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5001",
          "path": ["api", "banking", "search"]
        },
        "description": "Demonstrates Payload Analysis (Signal 4 & Layer 5). Engine scans query payload, detects SQL injection syntax, and blocks."
